tent="1-143634">Learn more about Hounslow Green Investment</div><div data-ai-no-open-words="" data-content="1-143635">The first phase of Hounslow Green Investment closed in September 2025, having raised £1 million. The next phase of investment will be launching soon, sign up for updates to get more news.</div><div data-ai-no-open-button-text="" data-content="1-143636">Sign up for updates</div><div data-ai-no-open-button-url="" data-content="1-143637">/signup-for-updates</div><div data-ai-no-past-invest-header="" data-content="1-143638">Placeholder</div><div data-ai-no-past-invest-copy="" data-content="1-143639">placeholder</div><div data-ai-no-past-invest-button-url="" data-content="1-143640">/</div><div data-ai-no-past-invest-button-text="" data-content="1-143641">Learn more</div><div data-ai-no-chart-img-url="" data-content="1-143642">https://cdn4.sharein.com/abundance/cms/e3111482-9dc4-4f66-8ecf-0635a45e1bb9.jpg</div><div data-ai-no-chart-img-alt="" data-content="1-143643">An image of a greening project</div><div data-ai-no-chart-img-caption="" data-content="2-143644">The council will invest in green energy projects across the borough</div></div><section class="position-relative bg-colour--primary-surface p-t-spacer-4xl type-white ai-hero" style="background:#187351"><div class="container"><div class="row brand-media-box align-items-start"><div class="col-12 col-md-8"><h1 class="text-choke-md--640 text-center--md font-secondary" style="color:#fff" data-content="1-143645">London Borough of Hounslow</h1><p class="body--xl text-choke-md--640 text-center--md m-b-spacer-sm" style="color:#fff" data-content="2-143649">Earn a stable long-term income while supporting local green initiatives that improve life in the borough.</p></div><div class="col-12 col-md-4"><div class="ai-heroLogoRail"><img class="image-responsive hero-header__illustration brand-media-box__img" src="https://cdn4.sharein.com/abundance/cms/4437b6f5-fc87-4e01-bd5a-631d09aa3ce3.png" alt="Hounslow Council logo" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"></div></div></div></div></section><div class="bg-colour--primary-surface bg-mask bg-mask--b-convex m-b-spacer-2xl ai-hero-mask" style="background:#187351"></div><div id="ai-scope-wrap"><section class="m-b-spacer-lg ai-scope"><div class="container text-choke-960"><div class="row"><div class="col-12 text-center" data-content="2-143654"><p class="body--xl">Hounslow declared a climate emergency in 2019, and the Cabinet adopted the Climate Emergency Action Plan in 2020. The Hounslow Green Investment will support the Council’s strategic sustainability goals, while giving everyone in the community the chance to get involved and benefit from the green transition.</p><p class="body--xl text-center"></p><blockquote class="brand-blockquote"><p class="font-secondary">Hounslow Green Investment is a great way for people to invest in the borough and make a decent return too. But more importantly, it is encouraging people to take an active role in lowering local carbon emissions.</p><footer class="choke-600 w-100 mx-auto"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn4.sharein.com/abundance/0b64b5ac-4546-4ad2-bb88-09d49186bce3.png" alt="Katherine Dunne" title="Image: https://cdn4.sharein.com/abundance/721452c5-0310-4766-847e-fbca0e347335.png"><div><p>Cllr Katherine Dunne</p><cite>Portfolio holder for Climate, Environment and Transport, Hounslow Council</cite></div></footer></blockquote><p></p></div></div></div></section><div class="bg-colour--primary-surface bg-mask bg-mask--t-convex ai-no-open-mask ai-scope" style="background-color: rgb(255, 237, 204);"></div><section class="home-green-investing position-relative p-y-spacer-xs bg-colour--primary-surface ai-no-open ai-scope" style="background-color: rgb(255, 237, 204);"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-12"><div class="flex-center"><h2 class="text-center m-b-spacer-sm">Learn more about Hounslow Green Investment</h2></div><div class="flex-center"><p class="body--lg text-center choke-800 m-b-spacer-sm">The first phase of Hounslow Green Investment closed in September 2025, having raised £1 million. The next phase of investment will be launching soon, sign up for updates to get more news.</p></div><div class="flex-center ai-no-open-btn-wrap"><a href="/signup-for-updates" class="brand-btn-grey--bordered brand-btn-grey--bordered--bordered btn btn--lg m-y-spacer-md btn--icon" style="border-color:#4c4c4a;color:#4c4c4a">Sign up for updates</a></div></div></div></div></section><div class="bg-colour--primary-surface bg-mask bg-mask--b-convex ai-no-open-mask ai-scope" style="background-color: rgb(255, 237, 204);"></div><div class="bg-colour--primary-surface bg-mask bg-mask--t-convex ai-open-bg ai-scope" style="display: none;"></div><section class="home-green-investing position-relative p-y-spacer-xs ai-open-bg ai-scope" style="display: none;"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-12"><div class="flex-center"><h2 class="text-center m-b-spacer-sm" data-content="1-143646">Invest in [investment name] today</h2></div><div class="flex-center"><div class="ai-custom ai-open-investments"><div id="ai-open-councils"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="bg-colour--primary-surface bg-mask bg-mask--b-convex ai-open-bg ai-scope" style="display: none;"></div><section class="home-financial m-y-spacer-md p-y-spacer-xl mx-auto choke-800 ai-scope"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-12"><div class="flex-center"><h2 class="text-center" data-content="1-143647">How your money is being used</h2></div><div class="flex-center"><p class="body--lg text-center choke-800 m-b-spacer-lg"><span data-content="2-143656"><span>Funds will be used to help fund energy efficiency, green energy and greening projects within existing council green programmes, including the&nbsp;</span>Hounslow Community Energy Fund, which supports community-led decarbonisation projects and the Thriving Communities Fund, which provides grants to chariti